{"product_id":"youre-not-the-boss-of-me","title":"You're Not the Boss of Me","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Save me! My child is acting like a brat!\" What parent hasn't thought her child was a brat at one point or another? Whether your child really is a brat, is at risk of becoming one, or is simply trying to grow up in a world filled with temptations and distractions, you'll love this book! It's the ultimate hands-on guide to cultivating character traits that are tried-and-true \"bratbusters.\" Full of no-nonsense, practical \"Tips and Scripts,\" You're Not the Boss of Me offers just the help you need to deal with many of the more challenging behaviors typical of four- to twelve-year-olds. With Betsy Brown Braun's humorous, supportive, and authoritative voice as a guide, navigating some of the most exasperating aspects of these formative years with confidence and laying the groundwork for your child's future just got a whole lot easier! It's All Here—What to Say and Do to Help Your Child: Get Over the Gimmes Tell the Truth Be Self-Reliant Develop Empathy Show Gratitude Be Respectful Take Responsibility Be Independent Exercise Humor and Not Be Spoiled!\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Betsy Brown Braun\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780061346637\u003cbr\u003e\nFormate: Papercover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595622387865,"sku":"1RB9780061346637","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/You_reNotTheBossOfMe.jpg?v=1752150887","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/youre-not-the-boss-of-me","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}